/* MARK: Cache descriptions */
"A self-contained Rust compiler, Cargo registry, and tools. Removing it does not delete source code, but the full toolchain must be installed again." = "獨立的 Rust 編譯器、Cargo 登錄檔與工具。移除不會刪除原始碼，但需要重新安裝完整工具鏈。";
"A separate downloaded Copilot CLI runtime channel. Local sessions and configuration under ~/.copilot are not targeted." = "另外下載的 Copilot CLI 執行環境頻道。不會影響 ~/.copilot 下的本機工作階段與設定。";
"AWS SSO login tokens and temporary credential cache. Re-generates on next aws sso login." = "AWS SSO 登入權杖與暫存憑證快取。下次執行 aws sso login 時會重新產生。";
"Android Virtual Devices and disk images. Must re-create in AVD Manager." = "Android 虛擬裝置與磁碟映像。需在 AVD Manager 中重新建立。";
"Arc's macOS cache container; spaces and profiles are not targeted." = "Arc 的 macOS 快取容器；不會影響 Spaces 與設定檔。";
"Archived builds for App Store or distribution. Re-archive from Xcode to recreate." = "用於 App Store 或發行的封存建置。可從 Xcode 重新封存來建立。";
"Bambu Studio's embedded web cache; projects and printer settings are not targeted." = "Bambu Studio 的內嵌網頁快取；不會影響專案與印表機設定。";
"Bazel build and repository caches. Re-populates on next bazel build." = "Bazel 建置與儲存庫快取。下次執行 bazel build 時會重新填入。";
"Blender's macOS cache container; blend files and preferences are not targeted." = "Blender 的 macOS 快取容器；不會影響 .blend 檔案與偏好設定。";
"Browser packages downloaded by Playwright for Go. Re-downloads when the matching Playwright Go version installs its driver." = "Playwright for Go 下載的瀏覽器套件。對應的 Playwright Go 版本安裝驅動程式時會重新下載。";
"Build products, indexes, and logs. Rebuilds automatically when you open a project." = "建置產物、索引與日誌。開啟專案時會自動重建。";
"Cached Brave Beta web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Brave Beta 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Brave Nightly web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Brave Nightly 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Brave web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Brave 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Bun packages. Re-downloads on bun install." = "Bun 套件快取。執行 bun install 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Chrome Canary web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Chrome Canary 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Chrome web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Chrome 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Chromium web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Chromium 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Conda environments and packages. Re-downloads on conda install." = "Conda 環境與套件快取。執行 conda install 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Dart/Flutter packages. Re-downloads on flutter pub get." = "Dart/Flutter 套件快取。執行 flutter pub get 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Deno modules and compiled scripts. Re-downloads on deno run." = "Deno 模組與編譯後指令稿快取。執行 deno run 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Edge Beta web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Edge Beta 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Edge Dev web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Edge Dev 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Edge web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Edge 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Opera web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Opera 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached PHP packages. Re-downloads on composer install." = "PHP 套件快取。執行 composer install 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Poetry dependencies and wheels. Re-downloads on poetry install." = "Poetry 相依套件與 wheel 快取。執行 poetry install 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Python packages from uv (fast pip alternative). Re-downloads on uv pip install." = "uv（快速 pip 替代方案）的 Python 套件快取。執行 uv pip install 時會重新下載。";
"Cached Vivaldi web resources; browser profile data is not targeted." = "Vivaldi 的網頁資源快取；不會影響瀏覽器設定檔資料。";
"Cached Yarn packages. Re-downloads on yarn install." = "Yarn 套件快取。執行 yarn install 時會重新下載。";
"Cached crate sources and registries. Re-downloads on cargo build." = "crate 原始碼與登錄檔快取。執行 cargo build 時會重新下載。";
"Cached package tarballs from npmjs.org. Re-downloads on npm install." = "來自 npmjs.org 的套件壓縮檔快取。執行 npm install 時會重新下載。";
"Carthage dependency build cache. Re-downloads on carthage update." = "Carthage 相依建置快取。執行 carthage update 時會重新下載。";
"ChatGPT Desktop app data. Conversations sync to cloud." = "ChatGPT Desktop 應用程式資料。對話會同步到雲端。";
"Chromium disk cache used by VS Code. Safe to delete, rebuilds on launch." = "VS Code 使用的 Chromium 磁碟快取。可安全刪除，啟動時會重建。";
"Claude Desktop and Claude CoWork store session state here. Deleting this is permanent — local sessions are not backed up to a server and do not come back." = "Claude Desktop 與 Claude CoWork 在此儲存工作階段狀態。刪除是永久的 — 本機工作階段不會備份到伺服器，也無法還原。";
"Codex HTTP cache only; task and account data are not targeted." = "僅 Codex HTTP 快取；不會影響任務與帳號資料。";
"Compiled package objects that make rebuilds fast (GOCACHE). Rebuilds itself — the first build after clearing is slower. Equivalent to go clean -cache." = "可加速重建的已編譯套件物件（GOCACHE）。會自動重建 — 清除後第一次建置會較慢。等同於 go clean -cache。";
"Content-addressable package store. Re-downloads on pnpm install." = "內容定址套件儲存庫。執行 pnpm install 時會重新下載。";
"CoreSimulator dyld and framework caches. Rebuilds automatically." = "CoreSimulator 的 dyld 與 framework 快取。會自動重建。";
"Cursor's whole application-support directory: workspace state, chat history, extensions and settings. Not a cache — deleting it is permanent." = "Cursor 的整個 Application Support 目錄：工作區狀態、聊天紀錄、擴充功能與設定。這不是快取 — 刪除是永久的。";
"Debug symbols for connected iPhones/iPads. Re-downloads when device connects." = "已連接 iPhone/iPad 的除錯符號。裝置連接時會重新下載。";
"Discord HTTP cache only." = "僅 Discord HTTP 快取。";
"Discord's macOS-native temporary resource cache." = "Discord 的 macOS 原生暫存資源快取。";
"Disposable graphics cache only." = "僅可丟棄的圖形快取。";
"Docker images, containers, and volumes. May lose running containers and uncommitted data!" = "Docker 映像、容器與磁碟區。可能會失去正在執行的容器與未提交的資料！";
"Downloaded AI/ML models, tokenizers, and datasets. Re-downloads on next use. Large models may take time." = "已下載的 AI/ML 模型、tokenizer 與資料集。下次使用時會重新下載。大型模型可能需要較長時間。";
"Downloaded Chromium binaries for Puppeteer. Re-downloads on npx puppeteer install." = "Puppeteer 下載的 Chromium 二進位檔。執行 npx puppeteer install 時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded Copilot CLI runtime versions and bundled dependencies. Local sessions, settings, plugins, and logs under ~/.copilot are not targeted." = "已下載的 Copilot CLI 執行環境版本與內附相依套件。不會影響 ~/.copilot 下的本機工作階段、設定、外掛與日誌。";
"Downloaded Firefox update payloads and updater state." = "已下載的 Firefox 更新內容與更新程式狀態。";
"Downloaded JARs, build outputs, and wrapper dists. Re-downloads on gradle build." = "已下載的 JAR、建置輸出與 wrapper 發行檔。執行 gradle build 時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded LLM model files. Re-downloads with ollama pull — large models take a while." = "已下載的 LLM 模型檔案。使用 ollama pull 重新下載 — 大型模型需要較長時間。";
"Downloaded Python wheels and sdists. Re-downloads on pip install." = "已下載的 Python wheel 與 sdist。執行 pip install 時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded Sparkle update payloads and installer staging files." = "已下載的 Sparkle 更新內容與安裝程式暫存檔。";
"Downloaded Swift packages. Re-downloads on next build (swift build)." = "已下載的 Swift 套件。下次建置（swift build）時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded browser binaries for Playwright testing. Re-downloads on npx playwright install." = "Playwright 測試用瀏覽器二進位檔。執行 npx playwright install 時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded extension VSIX packages. Safe to delete, re-downloads when needed." = "已下載的擴充功能 VSIX 套件。可安全刪除，需要時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded formula bottles and taps. Re-downloads on brew install." = "已下載的 formula bottle 與 tap。執行 brew install 時會重新下載。";
"Downloaded gem files. Rebuilds automatically with bundle install." = "已下載的 gem 檔案。執行 bundle install 時會自動重建。";
"Downloaded or staged Squirrel updater files." = "已下載或暫存的 Squirrel 更新檔。";
"Downloaded pod specs and sources. Re-downloads on pod install." = "已下載的 pod 規格與原始碼。執行 pod install 時會重新下載。";
"Electron/browser cache used by Unity Hub UI. Rebuilds automatically on next launch." = "Unity Hub 介面使用的 Electron／瀏覽器快取。下次啟動時會自動重建。";
"Emulator system images, one per API level and ABI. Re-download from Android Studio → SDK Manager. Often the largest part of the SDK." = "模擬器系統映像（每個 API 等級與 ABI 一組）。可從 Android Studio → SDK Manager 重新下載。通常是 SDK 中最大的部分。";
"Firefox Developer Edition cache files only." = "僅 Firefox Developer Edition 快取檔案。";
"Firefox web, startup, thumbnail, and safe-browsing caches." = "Firefox 網頁、啟動、縮圖與安全瀏覽快取。";
"Generated JavaScript and WebAssembly cache only." = "僅產生的 JavaScript 與 WebAssembly 快取。";
"Generated model preview images; source models are not targeted." = "產生的模型預覽圖；不會影響原始模型。";
"Generated model variants used for faster previews or compatibility." = "用於加快預覽或相容性的產生模型變體。";
"Generated previews for assets; original asset files are not targeted." = "資產的產生預覽；不會影響原始資產檔案。";
"GitHub Desktop HTTP cache only; repositories are not targeted." = "僅 GitHub Desktop HTTP 快取；不會影響儲存庫。";
"Go module download cache. Re-downloads on go mod download." = "Go 模組下載快取。執行 go mod download 時會重新下載。";
"Godot editor temp and shader cache. Rebuilds automatically on next launch." = "Godot 編輯器暫存與著色器快取。下次啟動時會自動重建。";
"Godot export templates for each engine version. Re-download from Godot → Export → Manage Export Templates." = "各引擎版本的 Godot 匯出範本。可從 Godot → Export → Manage Export Templates 重新下載。";
"Gradle distribution binaries downloaded by wrapper scripts. Re-downloads on next gradle build." = "由 wrapper 指令稿下載的 Gradle 發行二進位檔。下次執行 gradle build 時會重新下載。";
"HTTP cache for Codex's isolated browser partition." = "Codex 隔離瀏覽器分割區的 HTTP 快取。";
"IDE caches (IntelliJ, WebStorm, etc). Rebuilds on IDE restart." = "IDE 快取（IntelliJ、WebStorm 等）。重啟 IDE 時會重建。";
"Installed Rust toolchains (stable, beta, nightly) — a full compiler and standard library each. Reinstall with rustup toolchain install." = "已安裝的 Rust 工具鏈（stable、beta、nightly）— 每個都包含完整編譯器與標準函式庫。使用 rustup toolchain install 重新安裝。";
"Installed gems and docs. Reinstall with bundle install." = "已安裝的 gem 與文件。使用 bundle install 重新安裝。";
"Internal Xcode product caches. Rebuilds automatically on next build." = "Xcode 內部產品快取。下次建置時會自動重建。";
"Language runtimes installed by mise (Node, Python, Ruby, Go, etc.). Removing uninstalls them. Reinstall with mise install." = "由 mise 安裝的語言執行環境（Node、Python、Ruby、Go 等）。移除等同於解除安裝。使用 mise install 重新安裝。";
"Local Maven repository (.m2). Re-downloads on mvn build." = "本機 Maven 儲存庫（.m2）。執行 mvn build 時會重新下載。";
"Native Development Kit toolchains — a full compiler per installed version. Re-download from SDK Manager. Only needed for native (C/C++) Android builds." = "Native Development Kit 工具鏈 — 每個已安裝版本都包含完整編譯器。可從 SDK Manager 重新下載。僅在進行原生（C/C++）Android 建置時需要。";
"New Teams' macOS cache container." = "新版 Teams 的 macOS 快取容器。";
"Node.js headers and libraries, one set per Node version, used to compile native addons. Re-downloads on the next native build." = "用於編譯原生附加元件的 Node.js 標頭與函式庫（每個 Node 版本一組）。下次原生建置時會重新下載。";
"Node.js versions managed by nvm. Removing a version uninstalls it — reinstall with nvm install X.Y.Z." = "由 nvm 管理的 Node.js 版本。移除某個版本等同於解除安裝 — 使用 nvm install X.Y.Z 重新安裝。";
"Notion HTTP cache only." = "僅 Notion HTTP 快取。";
"Notion generated-code cache only." = "僅 Notion 產生的程式碼快取。";
"Notion graphics cache only." = "僅 Notion 圖形快取。";
"Obsidian HTTP cache only; vaults and metadata storage are not targeted." = "僅 Obsidian HTTP 快取；不會影響 vault 與中繼資料儲存。";
"Obsidian generated-code cache only." = "僅 Obsidian 產生的程式碼快取。";
"Obsidian graphics cache only." = "僅 Obsidian 圖形快取。";
"Old session logs and telemetry data. Safe to delete anytime." = "舊的工作階段日誌與遙測資料。隨時可安全刪除。";
"Pipenv virtual environments. Recreate with pipenv install." = "Pipenv 虛擬環境。使用 pipenv install 重新建立。";
"Prisma ORM query engine binaries. Re-downloads on npx prisma generate." = "Prisma ORM 查詢引擎二進位檔。執行 npx prisma generate 時會重新下載。";
"Python versions managed by pyenv. Removing uninstalls that version — reinstall with pyenv install X.Y.Z." = "由 pyenv 管理的 Python 版本。移除等同於解除安裝該版本 — 使用 pyenv install X.Y.Z 重新安裝。";
"RVM rubies and gemsets. Reinstall with rvm install X.Y.Z." = "RVM 的 Ruby 與 gemset。使用 rvm install X.Y.Z 重新安裝。";
"Raycast Store and API response cache. Clipboard history is explicitly excluded." = "Raycast Store 與 API 回應快取。剪貼簿歷史明確排除。";
"Registry metadata and dlx cache, kept separately from the package store. Re-downloads on next pnpm install." = "登錄檔中繼資料與 dlx 快取，與套件儲存庫分開存放。下次執行 pnpm install 時會重新下載。";
"Restored NuGet packages for .NET projects, one copy per package version. Re-downloads on dotnet restore." = ".NET 專案還原的 NuGet 套件（每個套件版本一份）。執行 dotnet restore 時會重新下載。";
"Ruby versions managed by mise. Reinstall with mise install ruby@X.Y.Z." = "由 mise 管理的 Ruby 版本。使用 mise install ruby@X.Y.Z 重新安裝。";
