"Signal graphics cache only." = "僅 Signal 圖形快取。";
"Simulator crash reports and diagnostic logs. Safe to remove anytime." = "模擬器當機報告與診斷日誌。隨時可安全移除。";
"Slack App Store cache container." = "Slack App Store 快取容器。";
"Slack HTTP cache only." = "僅 Slack HTTP 快取。";
