"Unity project starter templates downloaded by Unity Hub. Re-download from Hub when needed. Can be 300MB+." = "Unity Hub 下載的專案起始範本。需要時可從 Hub 重新下載。可能超過 300MB。";
"VLC's macOS cache container." = "VLC 的 macOS 快取容器。";
"VS Code application cache. Safe to delete, rebuilds automatically." = "VS Code 應用程式快取。可安全刪除，會自動重建。";
